  "body": "Currently Synapse uses OpenGraph to try and find an image. If that fails, it'll pick an image from the DOM. If the image from either fails to download (403, 404, too large, etc) then Synapse should just return a preview without an image. Currently, it instead throws a 502 error instead.",
